{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_title", "source_sha256": "b7f82dd2a85fea130d7eff7f5cd4cc7bb3d91ec9d115541e772c2e99a888a20d", "ja": "星を握るもの", "zh": "抓住星星的人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4b64fd9d32ead262013039c2d1fb512d5767b1676755e292e6d0f9a23e295d8b", "ja": "公演に向けて練習を続けるジュリア達。\n最後はひとりで歌うと決めたジュリアに、\n他のメンバーも付き合ってくれる。自分の\n夢を応援してくれる仲間の温かさに胸を\n打たれたジュリアは、公演の成功を誓う。", "zh": "茱莉亚等人为了公演持续练习。\n茱莉亚决定最后一首歌要独唱，\n其他成员也乐意配合。\n感受到伙伴们支持自己追梦的温暖心意，\n茱莉亚十分感动，发誓要让公演圆满成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ebade78df2482a54dcdf9743752c4314f9264030aae4ce2cf006207fcfc4af65", "ja": "（ジュリアのセンター公演に向け、レッスンが\n始まった。みんな、気合いが入ってるみたいだな）", "zh": "（茱莉亚的Center公演练习已经开始，\n大家看起来都很有干劲。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "65d04a7bad621958c651330ff320e4dc3886e9248f0dde20a04c30945b2374c2", "ja": "アタシは準備オッケー！\nいつでも始められるよ、ジュリア！", "zh": "我已经准备好了！\n随时都可以开始喔，茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "91e526c196e2c27e363d6e22f643219b3a1f2ea10db2c0817ad318ae1b93d2f9", "ja": "オレも、ウォーミングアップはバッチリだぜ♪\n今日はどういうメニューなんだ？", "zh": "我也彻底热好身了♪\n今天的训练菜单是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "cfa5310287109f20042dc08b60433222bd02152db39249dd6563186c7b0cf9da", "ja": "今日はっていうか、たぶん当日まで、\nダンスのレッスンが中心になると思う。", "zh": "今天的训练，或者应该说一直到表演当天，\n大概都会以舞蹈为主轴来练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "92e71fbaad3be92f349026271dc695d1479d7f53c65a0e3f768c28a07e487026", "ja": "あたしは、ダンスに苦手意識が強いからな。\nでも、今回はそんなこと言ってられない。", "zh": "我一直认定自己不擅长跳舞，\n但这次可不能继续说这种话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "b6aa93023292beff4e4b81b8fafcb3104f10cb2659bc2e848e8d6cdf211c9366", "ja": "ステージで、最高のパフォーマンスを見せるって\n決めたんだ。必ずやってやるぜ！", "zh": "因为我已经决定要在舞台上展现最精采的演出了，\n我说到就一定会做到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "ee33c8eae7630acfdc68fc369494243e1c659058278b555b88e8f2411ab22cee", "ja": "最高のパフォーマンスか……。\nサポートの私たちも、責任重大だね。", "zh": "最精采的演出啊……\n负责协助的我们也责任重大呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1007_p", "source_sha256": "58da5915f613f0a28a5fb8822614d6c28d698048887c5b310072f2f2d27dc2ef", "ja": "とはいえ、レッスンを始める前から固くなっていても\nいい事はないぞ。みんな、リラックスしていこう！", "zh": "虽说如此，但在训练开始前就太紧绷也不是好事，\n大家放松练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "96468f255cf7beeb5916ca9172211bb320ba3324172b9ac6054cd7810f956ef4", "ja": "さすがです、{$P$}さん！\nザ・普通のアドバイス、ナイスです！　パチパチパチ♪", "zh": "真不愧是{$P$}先生！\n给了非常普通的好建议！拍拍手♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0f3e5fd5aacc2b752f6787fd881ea09148b091f26010d12535668a74bfd35dfe", "ja": "はは……ありがとう。\nそれじゃあ、早速始めようか！", "zh": "哈哈……谢谢你啊。\n那就赶紧开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "8fcba41fc64ab40b3ad90ca9f3ed7b60c5b3ae8ab184521a902c2d0e8eee11b7", "ja": "ああ！　まずは、全体曲から合わせてみようか。\nみんな、よろしくな！　レイ、リード頼んだぜ！", "zh": "好！先从全体合唱曲开始练整体的配合吧，\n拜托大家了！丽，请你带头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "0d8f8d494974147916c2694fe926391782f125ba00d23b2aeff02045d9e76428", "ja": "はいは～い！\nそれじゃみんな、私についてきてね♪　それー！", "zh": "好呀好呀～！\n那大家跟着我的动作吧♪看我的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "9d79aa31355ce4a9479845ce15a590abbc19fd161c6158c94d92197ec4e54809", "ja": "ふんふふんふふ～ん♪", "zh": "哼哼哼哼～哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "7103e41cd235237e31922f3237345daad4548663e91676be206e164f491fc90c", "ja": "わっ！？　さすが麗花、\n速すぎて見えないぜ……！", "zh": "哇！？真不愧是丽花，\n动作快到看不见……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "dfee90cf51d5dddecde38b144c2aff8c4c94f6bda1ccfc9719da62ea02c5c53c", "ja": "今の、どうやって足を動かしたんだ……？\nえっと……。", "zh": "刚刚你的脚步是怎么踩的……？\n我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "44c8eb8ec6b40bd3ebb70ec13029d449895d785fbbf8e94f3aae78677b213357", "ja": "ワン・ツー・スリー・フォー♪\n鬼さん、こちら♪　足鳴る方へ♪", "zh": "1、2、3、4♪\n鬼来抓我呀♪找出拍脚的人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "843761e164da13dc5b2e4bef371a7f63ce79aec8f33f905f830cdac8814ed662", "ja": "誰が鬼だ！　っていうか、足が鳴るってなんだ！？\n……あー！　全然ついてけない！", "zh": "谁是鬼啊！话说拍脚又是什么！？\n……啊──！完全跟不上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "aa1aa57c2fe880d6f7360d3507557f4b2802419e2dce5162662f0083a418e185", "ja": "やるね、麗花さん！　でもアタシだって、\n足には自信があるよ！　ファイトー、オー！", "zh": "很厉害嘛，丽花姊！\n但我对腿力也是很有信心的！Fight──上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "5258bf1ebb019d67231c25c16a075431997d4b8399790ff40be68f6edfb1e603", "ja": "いや、だからなんで走り出すんだよ！？\nのり子！　戻ってこーい！", "zh": "为什么要跑起来啊！？\n法子！快回来──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "b0cf63a78cd5ca074a67ed71e8fb0e3eac4a5e2a5efd256da7655f91106a9082", "ja": "麗花さん、すごい……！　普段何か、\n特別なレッスンでもしてるんですか？", "zh": "丽花姊真厉害……！\n你平常有做什么特别的训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "b28ac924fac61b7773ef083988e3614967be600c1b15884e9de8f18ca42aa03e", "ja": "うーん、レッスンはみんなと同じはずだけど……あ。\nもしかしたら、山に登ってるからかも？", "zh": "唔～训练是都跟大家一样啦……\n啊，说不定是因为我有在爬山喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "3e2151dba6a5a9a7e4f5022cc9b28b57ff683e8b64c5fa426ebd758a165c9428", "ja": "山に……険しい山道で足腰が、酸素が薄い場所で\n肺活量が、自然と鍛えられているんですね！", "zh": "爬山……在险峻的山路上自然会锻炼下盘，\n在氧气稀薄的地方会自然锻炼肺活量对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "f3110ff7fd2110108bb4d07eb2f93623052ef3fb5c4675c68a1a9815381a772f", "ja": "なら公演までの間に、私たちも\n登山のスケジュールを組んで……何回登れるかな。", "zh": "那到公演之前，我们也来安排爬山行程……\n不知道能爬几次呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "c028a74ffe62eb7e87876c510e9269c22e84702af55e65f046a871daf4cad5fa", "ja": "琴葉、真面目に考えるな！　てか、まずは\n合わせるって言っただろ！　レイ、少しは手加減しろ！", "zh": "琴叶，别那么认真想！而且我刚刚不是说\n要先练整体的配合吗！？丽，拜托稍微放慢一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c91735f2389ed4ced93c07f2d63d029ac694aabc5e01c6d777938d109e8041ba", "ja": "うん、そうだな。まだ公演まで時間もあるし、\n焦ることはないぞ。ゆっくり、確実に進めていこう。", "zh": "嗯，说得没错，到公演前还有时间，\n不需要太着急，一步步踏实地前进吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "3a39f2e44299d7d5fd9701456b6dc3127e95da8bf7b9826cbf77e10183830604", "ja": "た、たしかにそうですね……。", "zh": "确、确实是这样没错呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "1782c1a51aeabbe2092b3f3c9ae8a7f25e13934f88fef6fbd2362780a7466382", "ja": "それじゃ、仕切り直しってコトで。\nゆっくりめのペースでいくぜ！", "zh": "那我们就重来一次，\n用稍慢一点的节奏来练吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "c6dc407cb09d2cf6fdf67c0e8f4aefdd3d8d2e24029af0e85b18cd560ec7e783", "ja": "それじゃ、改めて。いくよーっ！", "zh": "那就重新开始啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1029_p", "source_sha256": "0694f8193bfe715272c18aa823d42fb6c9cccc3ddd71c12b2bf6ec9e3ff4e18c", "ja": "（その後、レッスンは特に問題なく終わった。\nこの分なら、あまり心配する必要なさそうだな……）", "zh": "（之后的训练没有特别状况，顺利结束了。\n看样子似乎不太需要担心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1031_p", "source_sha256": "de81363b1dc04474f58f8903b01b70f71254a41860deefb708c137752e59c9ed", "ja": "（ん？　あそこにいるのは……）", "zh": "（嗯？在那边的人是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "e9d9a9097027cd569e6a8b5cdb514dda4992177aac4fc2ee5fe912c6cf26f708", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ。\n遅かったんだな、待ちくたびれたよ。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n你来得好晚，我都等得不耐烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1033_p", "source_sha256": "227a3aa726da6383aaf1ccb285b4d1e1bd48407cba127b9d05c0f1dbebe9c6b0", "ja": "ジュリア、帰ったんじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "茱莉亚？你不是回去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "03644e5527267ed8a081f418b0f4fee886f4f678413804170158a997ebd5e5f5", "ja": "やるコトがあったからな。それに、アンタと話も\nしたくてさ……途中まで一緒に帰ろう。いいだろ？", "zh": "因为我有点事要做，而且也想和你聊聊……\n回去的路上一起走一段吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1035_p", "source_sha256": "3f79be8c3b7fb4b9b628dd72fa2d065728fcb160930b6573e8d3580d3646374f", "ja": "もちろん構わないよ。\nそれで、ソロ曲のほうはどんな感じだ？", "zh": "当然没问题。\n个人曲的部分感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "e510ba859d7e49da1d99048919d1d8dd4e146c97d5fc6793f0fb065691c3d9a8", "ja": "バッチリだよ。ひとりで練習するつもりだったのに、\nみんな最後まで付き合ってくれてさ……。", "zh": "状况绝佳。我原本打算一个人练习，\n但大家还是陪我练到最后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "cd7a1e309947f2f418c34ba0263859bcddda6977454b4a154db5eba0d9dee709", "ja": "でも、お陰で本番を想定できたし、気合いも入った。\nいい練習になったよ。", "zh": "但多亏了她们，我才能在心里设想正式演出的状况，\n也唱得更起劲，练习很有收获。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1038_p", "source_sha256": "6da240967b356e0c3aac8ac6a1b30942cb56117376e3f1ac2281d9a72f8d8447", "ja": "そうか。\nみんなに、感謝しないとな。", "zh": "这样啊，\n那必须感谢大家呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "1f87ac9141301879c3f7610d7a450b600a203ff86f58f648fdaf76d7ab7b7a39", "ja": "ああ。……なあ、{$P$}。\n劇場のやつらって、すごくあったかいよな。", "zh": "是啊……{$P$}，我跟你说，\n剧场的每个人都很温暖呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "ccec072d79cba76f22754a2249842b05c1206f43417529db9185eab2422df7ef", "ja": "今回だって、『ロックなアイドルを表現したい』なんて\nあたしのワガママに、付き合ってくれて……。", "zh": "这次也是，\n居然还配合我『想展现摇滚偶像风采』的任性要求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_1041", "source_sha256": "c31936bc94d3ad1d7828581565bf589ba7146c5498dc1a67e9c140a781dc0389", "ja": "それは違う", "zh": "不是那样的", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2000_p", "source_sha256": "42f71163806c3b75d1c17bf31e8e7a762d6ec6109c28ccf02c766ccb189037ef", "ja": "それは違うよ。ジュリアのそれはワガママとかじゃ\nなくて、夢への挑戦。その大事な一歩だ。", "zh": "不是那样的，你说的不是任性要求，\n而是为了挑战梦想所迈出的重大一步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2001_p", "source_sha256": "09801478354d7fb8028336a554d701bb2a79f5217b0d783fddc3f5bbeea6af5f", "ja": "みんなも、その事をちゃんとわかってる。\nだから練習に付き合うんだ。仲間だからな。", "zh": "大家也都很清楚这件事，所以才会陪你练习。\n因为你们是伙伴啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2003_050jul", "source_sha256": "d2ad4e1237df93bcd7e9f65e58fbd4c46f1378d5653bd9523b025d4ad0ba25ff", "ja": "夢への挑戦の、第一歩か。\n……たしかに、そのとおりかもしれない。", "zh": "挑战梦想的第一步啊……\n也许正如你所说呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2004_050jul", "source_sha256": "6919e65d643d312ce5c02a88fd68eca534c683155be3ad9ae3c1f328db1edced", "ja": "あたしはさ、あんたにスカウトされて\nここに来た時、すごくドキドキしてたんだ。", "zh": "我啊，当初被你发掘来到这里时，\n心里其实很紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2005_p", "source_sha256": "3177edafd8bf4320f32f00f9cb07f2f5790ee1ffb398d7d0b288f5505df8b1d9", "ja": "そうか。……今はどうだ？", "zh": "是吗……那现在呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2006_050jul", "source_sha256": "5e72cfff08827e958982842eec630f81637760893764e197258eac71525c88e9", "ja": "今は……同じドキドキでも、ちょっと違う。\nひとり分の荷物じゃ、軽すぎるって知ったからかな。", "zh": "现在……虽然一样紧张，但又有点不一样，\n因为我已经明白，只属于一个人的负担实在太轻了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2007_050jul", "source_sha256": "4e75d7f72211baad2bdc661d91d90a46062bcf858cbac2c26ded3278a2886998", "ja": "今回、あたしはひとりで歌うけど。仲間たちに\n聞いて欲しくて、それでひとりで歌うのかもしれない。", "zh": "这次我虽然是独唱，\n但也许是因为想唱给伙伴们听，才选择独唱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2008_050jul", "source_sha256": "f402ef326bc958d0119bafaa605c56bc7f2c0846d09f301327181f6007f69df1", "ja": "……見てろよ、{$P$}。あたしは\nどこまでも駆け抜けてやる。みんなと一緒にな！", "zh": "……你好好看着吧，{$P$}，\n我会和大家一起奔驰到天涯海角！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2009_p", "source_sha256": "03ae1bdc16fd10735f069a7124d81dee242ab438fcdcc68bb8cddc22cec639f2", "ja": "わかった。けど、俺はプロデューサーだからな。\nジュリアの背中を見届けるために、一緒に走るよ。", "zh": "知道了，但我可是制作人啊。\n为了好好见证茱莉亚的背影，我也会一起跑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2010_p", "source_sha256": "2e4aa7552c4509b2e78833a0bf9abbb6f085a522d29f0468bc0d88e94fe0cf82", "ja": "公演、絶対に成功させような。", "zh": "我们一定要一起让公演圆满成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2011_050jul", "source_sha256": "757af97a31d0fbce90b5cdb832edc20b956c99d5c7fd7daa01d5e07618f5e488", "ja": "{$P$}……ははっ。\nやっぱ、あんた最高だよ！", "zh": "{$P$}……哈哈，\n你果然是最棒的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2012_050jul", "source_sha256": "8463e76dd8a5ac2c2857e58a9792a8e181b8d982f9ff9e50755770d3dd3570d0", "ja": "まかせろ！　今のあたしにできること……\n最高にロックなアイドルを、あんたにも見せてやるよ！", "zh": "包在我身上！\n我会让你看见我现在的实力……和最棒的摇滚偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2013_null", "source_sha256": "132d1ad42602eff719f5053f4d202bfcc3d53fcac522977d7932cc7bbe029b7c", "ja": "そして、公演当日……。", "zh": "接着，来到公演当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2014_audience", "source_sha256": "7a22f5944718cc2206842ddfd0dc71bb77725fc22bbc18118bd37e1a25cdb63e", "ja": "ワァァァァァ……！！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2015_050jul", "source_sha256": "a88b6f89820db1a3c3213b139c116d838bd3e8581940f693f6277667882a37a2", "ja": "みんな、ありがとう！\nそれじゃ……最後の曲だ。", "zh": "各位，谢谢你们！\n那么……这是最后一首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2016_043nor", "source_sha256": "01ca42e9a4a3f6a624d69751a46734febc4bf730d4615cd70e4cecd45204a141", "ja": "ジュリア、あとはまかせた！\n最高のフィナーレにしてよね！", "zh": "茱莉亚，接下来就交给你了！\n拜托你唱出最精采的压轴歌曲啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2017_047sub", "source_sha256": "fb3764b048350bc5bf2f4487b0c368578df3485063598d1abe733f2190f7aff0", "ja": "最後の最後は、グランドスラムで締めてくれよな♪", "zh": "最后的最后，一定要用满贯炮来收场喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2018_048rei", "source_sha256": "30dd65dcf7a4d07250c62e5940252a3fa2988cc8b0a3fbe95067a1412c8eb4e1", "ja": "登山は、頂上からの「やっほー！」が\n一番気持ちいいんだよ！　最高の山びこ、待ってるね♪", "zh": "登山时，从山顶喊出「呀呵──！」是最畅快的！\n我很期待最棒的回音喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2019_017kth", "source_sha256": "c4b46838cd52884f97c1a221c9f327f1ac510f0dc777988843badf0b04af9c53", "ja": "ジュリアちゃん。\n私たち、最後まで見守ってるから。", "zh": "茱莉亚，\n我们会在一旁支持你到最后的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2020_050jul", "source_sha256": "355537ae3e93b1a974fbfe3465194ef84b8ce017388a1746d6924a2a9390df47", "ja": "ああ！　……これから歌う最後の曲は、\nあたしが、ひとりで歌いたいってみんなに頼んだんだ。", "zh": "好！\n……最后要唱的这首歌，是我拜托大家让我独唱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2021_050jul", "source_sha256": "cea1adf1ca46164f8e172edda5bc07a5a9afe69c7468d80b211d9d5865088f7b", "ja": "でもこの曲が歌えるのは、あたしひとりの力じゃない。\n765プロのみんな、支えてきてくれた人たち……。", "zh": "但我能唱出这首歌，靠的不是我一个人的力量，\n而是765艺能的大家、支持我到现在的每个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2022_050jul", "source_sha256": "c3ee58b3ce6e3482b6527aba22ef0256644e5b0077e1d1b01fcae599f5d81a75", "ja": "そして、この会場にいるみんなが、あたしを\n夢と一緒にここまで運んでくれたから、歌えるんだ。", "zh": "还有在会场里的你们，是所有人把我连同我的梦想\n一起带到这里，我才能在此演唱这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_041_2023_050jul", "source_sha256": "fd100f5689d0cf4060e265371ebc15849f91d4f22135deeab829eb3755585e96", "ja": "それじゃ、準備はいいか？　聞いてくれ。\n……『流星群』。", "zh": "那么，准备好了吗？请大家欣赏这首歌……\n『流星雨』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
